'''THE METAL SLOTH''' (はぐれケモルル, ''Hagurekemoruru'') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant of [[THE SLOTH]] that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 6.4 Update|Version 6.4]].

