==Enemy==
This Sloth outranges many [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare]] and [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare]] [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]], and has a quick attack rate. It also moves fast compared to most Metal enemies. However, the rest of its stats are low, comparable to [[Super Metal Hippoe]].

==Strategy==
Because of its long range and quick attack rate, the best choice when fighting THE METAL SLOTH is often to bring [[:Category:Critter-class Cats|Critters]] with even longer range, such as [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Cat]], [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Waitress Cat]] and [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Aku Researcher]]. While it does outrange most Metal crowd-controllers, if you happen to have [[Talents|Talented]] [[Panties Cat (Special Cat)|Lollycat]], they do outrange this sloth, which does help counter their ironically high speed.

