==Trivia==
*In the first [[Media:Silver img01 en.jpg|event poster]] for [[Silver Week]], THE METAL SLOTH was referred to as "Mercury Sloth", which was the only name it had until it was added to the [[Enemy Guide]] in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]].
*Its Japanese name, Hagurekemoruru, is a portmanteau of ''hagureta'', meaning "stray", and "Namarukemoruru", [[THE SLOTH]]'s Japanese name.
**Since [[Metal Snache]] is seemingly based on the [[wikia:dragonquest:Metal slime|Metal Slime]] from ''[[wikipedia:Dragon Quest|Dragon Quest]]'', this is probably intended as a reference to the [[wikia:dragonquest:Liquid metal slime|Liquid Metal Slime]], which is known as ''Haguremetaru'' (はぐれメタル, "Stray Metal") in Japan.
*It is one of the few enemies whose health and attack power are equal.

